<div class="Story">
<div class="Story-section">
    <h4 class="Story-title">Base (the lines of one order, resolved together)</h4>
    <p class="Story-label">
        Takes the lines of a real order and resolves them in one pass, which is the point of the
        component: a card left to itself costs four calls, paid once per line. With no order to
        pass it renders nothing, so the story shows the empty state. It serves the order pages of
        the account as well as the page opened from the link in a confirmation mail.
    </p>
